abstract: "Typed scientific contexts and observation contracts, a finite-plan cache checker, and Lean proofs of exact finite-semantic preservation and variation-aware composition with transported references. Includes a controlled external Drell-Yan midpoint-versus-bin comparison and reproducible numerical evidence; the formal proofs do not verify Python, numerical accuracy or QCD."
